Subject: [PATCH 3/4] crypto: reusable jitterentropy

Use 6.18 jitterentropy source code.
We're doing this because it allows us to say that our 6.12 and
6.18 jitterentropy object builds are actually the same thing but
built for two different platforms, which means we can submit them at the same
time.

This patch is for 6.18, so it is empty. It exists to make the two patch series
match.
